.TH "CADDY-MAN" "1" "September 2021"
.SH NAME
.HP
caddy-man \- Print manual pages for Caddy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP
caddy man 
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Creates subfolder "man" in current directory and prints manual pages for Caddy and its available subcommands into.

.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
